{\rtf\ansi \deff0{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue128;}{\fonttbl{\f0
\fcharset0\fnil Arial;}}\plain\cf1\fs20 \pard The number of non-zero 
values of the spatial average filter has been chosen to be an odd 
number. This enables to center the filter around (0,0), i.e. to 
convert the filter to DFT order from FT order. I have made use of the 
pod function to translate the filter in time domain, which converts to 
a phase shift in the frequency domain.}
