\fcharset0\fnil Arial;}}\plain\cf1\fs20 \pard NOTE\par When the image 
is filtered with the non-causal filter, it is observed the original 
location of the filtered image has been preserved. This is very useful 
in digital image processins as it save one from trying to relocate the 
filtered image compared with the original image.}
